<title>UK: Iran buys 30,000 T raw sugar for May -traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys 30,000 T raw sugar for May -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran's Government Trading Corporation (GTC) bought 30,000 tonnes of raw sugar at $273.00 per tonne for shipment in May, European traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The supplier was a France-based trade house, they said.</p>
<p>Last month the GTC bought the same quantity of raws at $269.00 from London-based suppliers for March/May shipment.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
